WEBVTT

00:12:25.751 --> 00:12:31.552
Typically, public health transformations
take a long time, even decades.

00:12:32.052 --> 00:12:34.847
But this approach had delivered results

00:12:34.871 --> 00:12:36.609
in two years.

00:12:38.387 --> 00:12:40.140
But here's the best part.

00:12:40.164 --> 00:12:44.491
There is actually nothing
Rajasthan-specific about what we learned.

00:12:45.198 --> 00:12:50.484
In fact, this approach
of using the citizen to trigger motivation

00:12:50.508 --> 00:12:53.574
is not even limited
to public health systems.

00:12:54.969 --> 00:12:59.778
I sincerely believe
that if there is any public system,

00:12:59.802 --> 00:13:01.397
in any country,